              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kelley Sander"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love this. I mainly use it as a marinade for chicken fajitas that I make in my cast iron skillet. I just throw in a red onion and bell pepper and omit the cayenne since I'm cooking for my kids. The leftovers make delicious quesadillas the following day.",
            "datePublished": "2019-01-05T17:14:04.433Z"
