              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "canesmojo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Threaded with baby Bella mushroom, bell pepper, red onion, and cherry tomatoes. Grilled over indirect heat with a few hickory smoker chips. Served with Spanish potato salad. Used a bit more lime than called for. Will definitely do it again.",
