            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Crystal Shirley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We smoked/grilled these kabobs with hickory wood and they were fantastic! I cooked the chicken with pineapple, bell pepper, and purple onion. I'll make this again, but I'll cut back slightly on the spice.",
            "datePublished": "2020-08-20T00:22:08.103Z"
