            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jordan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent recipe! I altered it a little bit to fit an idea I had, but used all the same ingredients in the recipe. I made whole chicken breasts instead of kabobs and once they were grilled I added a little extra lime and some shredded cheese and broiled it until the cheese was melted. I put the chicken breast on a bed of the multi colored salad topping tortilla strips with a side of steamed broccoli! Yumm!",
