              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Noelle Pettit-Leisey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a great low-sodium dinner. I doubled the marinade recipe for the chicken and used 3 limes total. I marinated for about 7 hours and served with some farro. I also made another batch of marinade (as written) for veggies and marinated them for 3 hours. This was very tasty and will definitely make it again!",
