              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Toolbox Rich"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is an awesome recipe. Save a very small amount of marinade, and just before grilling, throw a bunch of cut up veggies in a bag with the marinade for a light coat of flavour. I put onions, peppers, mushrooms, and zucchini on mine, along with pieces of farmer sausage. Great combination!",
